class=3D"v3-tab-verdict">5 tabs =C2=B7 assembled by hand =C2=B7 every singl=
e time</div></div></div></div><div class=3D"inline-div-4"><h2 class=3D"inli=
ne-h2-0">The same task.<br>=E2=80=8D<em>Two very different worlds.</em></h2=
><p class=3D"v3-body-copy inline-p-1">One sentence takes you from 90 second=
s of clicking to 8 seconds of done.<br>This is not an incremental improveme=
nt. It is a different way of working entirely.</p><div class=3D"v3-compare-=
wrap"><div class=3D"v3-compare-side v3-before"><span class=3D"v3-compare-la=
bel">The old way</span><div class=3D"v3-compare-h inline-div-0">Five clicks=
.<br>Three screens.</div><p class=3D"v3-compare-p inline-p-2">Navigate, fin=
d, edit, save, confirm. On some platforms, the user cannot even do this the=
mselves and has to call support.</p><div class=3D"v3-compare-stat">~90 seco=
nds =C2=B7 or 1 phone call</div></div><div class=3D"v3-compare-side v3-afte=
r"><span class=3D"v3-compare-label">Ask Nanci</span><div class=3D"v3-compar=
e-h inline-div-2">One sentence.<br>Done.</div><p class=3D"v3-compare-p inli=
ne-p-3">Update Oak Street Coffee's phone to 214-555-0142. Confirmed, execut=
ed, logged. No navigation. No support ticket.</p><div class=3D"v3-compare-s=
tat">~8 seconds =C2=B7 zero navigation</div></div></div></div></div></secti=
on><section id=3D"shift" class=3D"v3-dark inline-section-0"><div class=3D"v=
3-section-inner"><span class=3D"v3-eyebrow">The shift</span><div class=3D"v=
3-thesis">It is not <span class=3D"v3-strike">a smarter UI.</span><br>It is=
 <em>intent replacing navigation.</em><br><br>You say what you need. Action=
able insights appears. Ask Nanci is the connective tissue.<br></div><div cl=
ass=3D"inline-div"><p class=3D"v3-lead">Every workflow your team runs today=
 still exists. The queues, the panels, the case management, the risk tools.=
 Ask Nanci does not replace any of it. It removes the navigation tax. Ask N=
anci accelerates the work they're good at.</p></div></div></section><sectio=
n id=3D"panels" class=3D"v3-dark inline-section-0"><div class=3D"v3-section=
-inner"><span class=3D"v3-eyebrow">Intent + work</span><h2>Ask Nanci carrie=
s <em>intent.</em><br>Panels are where the <em>work happens.</em></h2><p cl=
ass=3D"v3-lead">Ask Nanci is not a chatbot. It is the layer that connects e=
verything your team already uses and routes every request to the right view=
 automatically.</p><p class=3D"v3-lead inline-p-0">Five ways Ask Nanci resp=
onds.</p><p class=3D"v3-body-copy inline-p-1">The interaction pattern that =
